  "stem": {
    "zh-CN": "在[[term:transformer|Transformer]]的训练中，以下哪些技术用于稳定训练或加速收敛?",
    "en-US": "Which techniques are used to stabilize training or speed convergence when training a [[term:transformer|Transformer]]?"
  },
  "explanation": {
    "zh-CN": "四项技术均能稳定训练或加速收敛。预热避免初期震荡，裁剪防[[term:gradient-explosion|梯度爆炸]]，[[term:residual-connection|残差连接]]改善梯度流动，[[term:layer-normalization|层归一化]]稳定激活分布。",
    "en-US": "All four techniques can stabilize training or speed convergence. Warmup avoids early oscillation, clipping prevents [[term:gradient-explosion|exploding gradients]], [[term:residual-connection|residual connections]] improve gradient flow, and [[term:layer-normalization|LayerNorm]] stabilizes activation distributions."
  },
